1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,549 --> 00:00:29,533
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,487 --> 00:00:39,746
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,486 --> 00:00:44,036
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,142 --> 00:00:48,582
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,052 --> 00:00:52,733
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,357
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,397 --> 00:01:03,168
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,527 --> 00:01:11,022
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,049 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 3=

12
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,239
What did you do?

13
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:21,239
Why have we ended up like this?

14
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:22,400
It's all because of you.

15
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,799
Everyone has
three souls and seven spirits.

16
00:01:25,079 --> 00:01:26,719
Why do you only have
a wisp of your soul left?

17
00:01:27,159 --> 00:01:28,280
To save you,

18
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:30,079
I had to trade my soul for yours.

19
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:31,840
That wisp of your soul

20
00:01:31,959 --> 00:01:33,359
can't sustain this body.

21
00:01:34,439 --> 00:01:35,560
So from now on,

22
00:01:36,159 --> 00:01:37,000
we're stuck like this?

23
00:01:37,879 --> 00:01:38,599
In your dreams.

24
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,640
Once I return to the Shaman Clan
and retrieve the Myriad Souls Lamp,

25
00:01:40,799 --> 00:01:41,959
I'll make your soul whole again.

26
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,359
Then we can switch back.

27
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,640
Myriad Souls Lamp...

28
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,200
By the way,

29
00:01:46,519 --> 00:01:47,200
let me ask you something.

30
00:01:48,159 --> 00:01:49,560
Did we know each other before?

31
00:01:50,879 --> 00:01:51,840
Didn't we

32
00:01:52,159 --> 00:01:53,599
just meet last night?

33
00:01:56,239 --> 00:01:56,920
Really?

34
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:58,879
You and I

35
00:01:59,159 --> 00:02:00,280
have never met before?

36
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:01,719
Not that

37
00:02:02,599 --> 00:02:03,319
I remember.

38
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:06,840
(Then those images in my memory...)

39
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:07,879
(where did they come from?)

40
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:09,719
(Could it be)

41
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:10,800
(the future?)

42
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,800
Don't touch me!

43
00:02:19,599 --> 00:02:21,520
Then... is there no other way?

44
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,520
So from now on,

45
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,240
by day you'll attend court in my place,

46
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,439
while I

47
00:02:26,879 --> 00:02:28,120
act as a shamaness in yours?

48
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:32,240
You'd better do as you're told.

49
00:02:32,759 --> 00:02:33,520
Otherwise,

50
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:36,400
who knows what mischief I might do

51
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:38,039
with your body?

52
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:40,479
Miss,

53
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:43,000
now that we can keep each other
in check,

54
00:02:43,599 --> 00:02:44,520
such threats

55
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,360
aren't really necessary, are they?

56
00:02:46,479 --> 00:02:47,520
You call that a threat?

57
00:02:48,159 --> 00:02:48,879
Let me tell you,

58
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:50,520
soul-swapping isn't
the only trick I know.

59
00:02:50,639 --> 00:02:52,520
Have you heard of the Shaman Clan's
forbidden art, the Chu Phoenix Call?

60
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:54,639
Watch it, or I'll use
the Chu Phoenix Call,

61
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,599
reverse time,
go back to when you were little,

62
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,800
and torment you from childhood on.

63
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,199
You must never use the Chu Phoenix Call!

64
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:00,879
Why not?

65
00:03:01,159 --> 00:03:02,000
No reason.

66
00:03:03,719 --> 00:03:04,960
Why are you yelling at me?

67
00:03:05,439 --> 00:03:06,599
I shouldn't have saved you.

68
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:20,520
What's wrong?

69
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:22,000
It's telling me

70
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:23,960
there was something else back there.

71
00:03:25,039 --> 00:03:26,560
We've already come this far.

72
00:03:27,039 --> 00:03:27,719
Don't tell me

73
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:28,800
we have to go back.

74
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,240
This is...

75
00:03:47,919 --> 00:03:49,479
What character is this?

76
00:03:51,479 --> 00:03:53,080
There are characters you don't know?

77
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,280
Miss Chu Li,

78
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,080
you really hold a grudge.

79
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,120
This is Shaman Clan script.

80
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,479
It should be an incantation.

81
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:04,280
I'm not sure exactly what it says.

82
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,879
But the color of these characters...

83
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,080
Why is it red?

84
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,000
Is it blood?

85
00:04:11,919 --> 00:04:12,800
Seems like more than that.

86
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:16,839
The reason this moonflower
turned into a demon

87
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:19,319
is very likely connected
to this bamboo slip.

88
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:21,199
I'll take it back
and ask the Grand Shaman.

89
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,319
She might know.

90
00:04:24,839 --> 00:04:25,800
(I also need to ask her...)

91
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:28,600
(She's been hot and cold with me
for years. I could overlook that.)

92
00:04:29,279 --> 00:04:30,600
(But this time, why did she let Yun Hua)

93
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:32,000
(drive me out of the Shaman Clan?)

94
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,959
(Does she even see me
as her own daughter?)

95
00:04:41,959 --> 00:04:42,839
Diviner Song,

96
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:45,319
now that you know the whole story,

97
00:04:45,639 --> 00:04:47,000
and you're occupying my body,

98
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:47,839
you should

99
00:04:47,959 --> 00:04:49,800
go back and clear your name now, right?

100
00:04:52,279 --> 00:04:52,920
Then...

101
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:55,720
Then what about my face?

102
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,560
We'll deal with it when we get back.

103
00:05:09,439 --> 00:05:10,759
You dared to break out of prison?

104
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,560
You've got a death wish.

105
00:05:14,079 --> 00:05:14,759
Yun Hua,

106
00:05:15,439 --> 00:05:16,639
our master is in seclusion.

107
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,199
You were only appointed
acting Grand Shaman.

108
00:05:19,959 --> 00:05:21,680
What right do you have to punish Chu...

109
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:23,879
punish me?

110
00:05:29,839 --> 00:05:31,199
Don't tell me you think

111
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:33,040
you have a chance
at becoming Grand Shaman.

112
00:05:33,399 --> 00:05:34,160
Chu Li,

113
00:05:34,639 --> 00:05:36,079
shall I remind you?

114
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:38,199
Breaking out of prison is a grave crime.

115
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:39,240
You...

116
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,279
I was the one who let her out.

117
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,399
Diviner Song, you...

118
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,319
I have now investigated the matter.

119
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:55,879
The one causing trouble in the city
was a Flower Demon.

120
00:05:57,720 --> 00:06:00,040
That Flower Demon had immense power,

121
00:06:00,399 --> 00:06:01,560
but Miss Chu Li

122
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,319
risked her life

123
00:06:03,439 --> 00:06:04,560
and nearly died

124
00:06:04,959 --> 00:06:06,759
before subduing the Flower Demon.

125
00:06:06,959 --> 00:06:08,959
She's truly a heroine.

126
00:06:09,519 --> 00:06:10,519
What Flower Demon?

127
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:12,560
Diviner Song, don't let her fool you!

128
00:06:16,079 --> 00:06:17,000
Yun Hua, what are you doing?

129
00:06:20,279 --> 00:06:20,920
Song...

130
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,279
I've already testified for her.

131
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,360
Yet you won't let it go.

132
00:06:24,519 --> 00:06:25,279
What's your motive?

133
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,040
You...

134
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:27,920
Don't "you" me.

135
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:28,959
True or false,

136
00:06:29,079 --> 00:06:30,360
the Grand Shaman will decide.

137
00:06:30,839 --> 00:06:32,240
What right do you have to punish her?

138
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:33,720
And what right do you have
to question me?

139
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:35,879
I...

140
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:36,959
I've said my piece.

141
00:06:37,199 --> 00:06:39,120
I'm going with Miss Chu Li
to see the Grand Shaman.

142
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:40,759
You can't!

143
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,839
Isn't the Grand Shaman in seclusion?

144
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:45,759
Why can't we see her?

145
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:48,560
She...

146
00:06:51,319 --> 00:06:52,480
She can't be disturbed.

147
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,439
Diviner Song,
what's the meaning of this?

148
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,360
If you wish to see the Grand Shaman,

149
00:07:08,519 --> 00:07:09,639
we'll announce your arrival.

150
00:07:09,839 --> 00:07:11,160
Why such disregard for propriety?

151
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,480
- You...
- Yun Hua.

152
00:07:13,399 --> 00:07:14,920
The King has always
valued the Shaman Clan.

153
00:07:15,399 --> 00:07:17,079
Now that the Grand Shaman
has been in seclusion so long,

154
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,399
it's only natural for Diviner Song
to worry.

155
00:07:20,759 --> 00:07:21,360
Exactly.

156
00:07:21,639 --> 00:07:22,920
The Grand Shaman is in seclusion.

157
00:07:23,079 --> 00:07:23,920
No one may enter.

158
00:07:24,519 --> 00:07:26,279
When Miss Chu Li was subduing the demon,

159
00:07:26,399 --> 00:07:27,399
she found something strange

160
00:07:27,639 --> 00:07:28,959
and would like the Grand Shaman
to identify it.

161
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,040
Why is that not allowed?

162
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:30,839
Step aside.

163
00:07:34,879 --> 00:07:35,839
(What's all the noise?)

164
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,079
Grand Shaman,

165
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,000
are you all right?

166
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:43,920
(I'm fine.)

167
00:07:44,519 --> 00:07:46,279
(Thank you for your concern,
Diviner Song.)

168
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:47,800
(Diviner Song,)

169
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:49,319
(please take your leave.)

170
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,560
Grand Shaman,

171
00:07:51,879 --> 00:07:53,439
then we'll take our leave.

172
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:00,680
Grand Shaman,

173
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:03,120
as Diviner of Chu State,

174
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:05,319
it's my duty to care for your wellbeing.

175
00:08:05,959 --> 00:08:07,800
Please grant me an audience,

176
00:08:08,319 --> 00:08:09,800
so I can report back to the King.

177
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:11,160
Diviner Song,

178
00:08:11,319 --> 00:08:12,800
why put us in such a difficult position?

179
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,160
(If it must be so,)

180
00:08:14,959 --> 00:08:16,680
(then let Diviner Song enter.)

181
00:08:27,723 --> 00:08:30,976
(Yaohua, Grand Shaman of Chu State)

182
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:31,920
Diviner Song,

183
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,600
I'm unable to greet you properly.

184
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,279
Please forgive me.

185
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,039
Grand Shaman,

186
00:08:39,519 --> 00:08:40,559
I meant no offense.

187
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,360
Please forgive me.

188
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:44,240
Thank you for your concern,
Diviner Song.

189
00:08:45,039 --> 00:08:45,759
Grand Shaman,

190
00:08:46,399 --> 00:08:47,799
since Chu Li is innocent,

191
00:08:48,159 --> 00:08:49,759
may she return to the Shaman Clan?

192
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,240
Chu Li has been unruly since childhood.

193
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:55,720
The Flower Demon wasn't her doing,

194
00:08:56,279 --> 00:08:58,279
but she's caused plenty
of other trouble.

195
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:01,879
I've already had Yun Hua
expel her from the Shaman Clan.

196
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,759
She must leave Jinan City.

197
00:09:05,519 --> 00:09:07,000
Why must you drive me...

198
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,320
drive her out of the city?

199
00:09:17,799 --> 00:09:19,440
Please reconsider, Grand Shaman.

200
00:09:20,399 --> 00:09:21,240
Diviner Song,

201
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:25,039
though we fall under your jurisdiction,

202
00:09:25,519 --> 00:09:27,639
the internal affairs of the Shaman Clan

203
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:31,240
are not for you to meddle in.

204
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:32,200
You...

205
00:09:32,399 --> 00:09:33,759
Thank you for speaking up for me,
Diviner Song.

206
00:09:35,039 --> 00:09:36,120
But I don't wish

207
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,679
to defy the Grand Shaman's order.

208
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:40,759
Let's not disturb the Grand Shaman
any further.

209
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,879
Diviner Song, please take your leave.

210
00:09:54,519 --> 00:09:55,559
Yun Hua, see him out.

211
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:57,600
Diviner Song, please take your leave.

212
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:12,519
Chu Li.

213
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:16,679
You're no longer welcome
in the Shaman Clan.

214
00:10:16,879 --> 00:10:18,240
Don't come back
and make a nuisance of yourself.

215
00:10:18,679 --> 00:10:20,519
If you cause any more trouble,

216
00:10:20,759 --> 00:10:21,519
don't blame me...

217
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:22,440
Yun Hua,

218
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:24,799
even if I'm no longer
part of the Shaman Clan,

219
00:10:25,639 --> 00:10:27,399
I still have Diviner Song backing me.

220
00:10:28,159 --> 00:10:29,559
It's not your place to lecture me.

221
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:30,720
You...

222
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:32,799
That's right.

223
00:10:33,559 --> 00:10:35,879
I'll always back Miss Chu Li.

224
00:10:44,183 --> 00:10:46,276
(Song Residence)

225
00:10:52,279 --> 00:10:54,519
Watching you write with my face

226
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:57,240
feels so strange.

227
00:11:02,039 --> 00:11:02,799
What are you writing?

228
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,440
I need to ask the King for leave.

229
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,879
I can't attend court
for the next few days.

230
00:11:09,799 --> 00:11:10,600
I can't possibly

231
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,440
have you go in my place.

232
00:11:12,879 --> 00:11:14,600
Why can't I attend court in your place?

233
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,399
Do you know palace etiquette?

234
00:11:21,759 --> 00:11:23,200
Do you know my duties?

235
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,879
Do you know how to answer the King?

236
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:28,240
Aren't you afraid you'll say
the wrong thing

237
00:11:28,879 --> 00:11:29,879
and the King might...

238
00:11:33,799 --> 00:11:34,639
Never mind.

239
00:11:35,519 --> 00:11:36,639
I don't want to go anyway.

240
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,000
Now,

241
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,440
I need you to have this

242
00:11:42,639 --> 00:11:43,840
delivered to the palace.

243
00:11:44,879 --> 00:11:45,759
Don't forget,

244
00:11:46,279 --> 00:11:47,120
right now,

245
00:11:48,559 --> 00:11:49,639
you're Song Ziyuan.

246
00:11:57,159 --> 00:11:58,080
Fine, I'll go.

247
00:12:04,783 --> 00:12:08,970
(47 Days Before the City Falls)

248
00:12:20,759 --> 00:12:21,600
Mr. Zhong,

249
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,799
why are you so busy lately?

250
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,960
(Zhong Jiang)
The palace ordered a batch of vessels.

251
00:12:27,639 --> 00:12:29,480
Diviner Song is coming
to inspect tomorrow.

252
00:12:30,559 --> 00:12:31,639
I have to get them finished.

253
00:12:32,559 --> 00:12:33,440
No wonder.

254
00:12:33,919 --> 00:12:36,320
Business must be booming, Mr. Zhong.

255
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,399
By the way,

256
00:12:38,799 --> 00:12:39,639
I haven't seen

257
00:12:39,639 --> 00:12:41,279
Wan out and about in a while.

258
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:42,759
I brought her something.

259
00:12:43,799 --> 00:12:44,679
Where is she?

260
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:49,440
My daughter...

261
00:12:55,399 --> 00:12:56,200
She's ill.

262
00:12:59,399 --> 00:13:01,639
Then she needs to get plenty of rest.

263
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:02,919
Well,

264
00:13:03,159 --> 00:13:04,120
I'll leave this here.

265
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,159
Pass it to her for me.

266
00:13:11,714 --> 00:13:18,457
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

267
00:13:18,870 --> 00:13:25,537
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

268
00:13:25,906 --> 00:13:29,233
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

269
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:32,600
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

270
00:13:32,928 --> 00:13:39,588
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

271
00:13:40,012 --> 00:13:46,668
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

272
00:13:46,955 --> 00:13:53,324
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

273
00:13:53,493 --> 00:13:56,920
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

274
00:13:57,182 --> 00:14:00,395
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

275
00:14:00,435 --> 00:14:07,316
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

276
00:14:07,670 --> 00:14:11,200
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

277
00:14:11,356 --> 00:14:14,923
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

278
00:14:15,315 --> 00:14:21,760
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

279
00:14:50,669 --> 00:14:57,339
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

280
00:14:57,590 --> 00:15:03,880
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
